@HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Test Protected Endpoint Without Token (Expected: 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/owner-test
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Register a Canteen Owner
# @name register
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Chetan Lokhande",
  "email": "owner@canteen.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "canteenId": null
}

###

### 3. Login as Canteen Owner (Obtain JWT)
# @name login
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@canteen.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### Store Token from response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 4. Test Protected Endpoint With Token (Expected: 200 OK)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/owner-test
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Create Canteen (Owner Only)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/canteens
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Main Campus Canteen",
  "location": "Building A, Ground Floor",
  "isActive": true
}

###

### 6. Get All Canteens (Public)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/canteens
Accept: application/json

###
